1. Audit Purpose

This independent audit verifies the committed Gate 2 / G2-A ActionPacket
lifecycle and kill-switch implementation against preflight revision v0.1.5.
It audits committed bytes only. It does not repair runtime or tests, grant
authority, execute a real connector, close Gate 2, claim RC2, or start G2-B.

